<title>FRANCE: French bank robbers beat traffic on mountain bikes.</title>
<headline>French bank robbers beat traffic on mountain bikes.</headline>
<dateline>LILLE, France 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Two French bank robbers beat heavy traffic in the northern city of Lille by making their getaway on mountain bikes, scattering startled pedestrians, police said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Armed with automatic pistols, the men in their early twenties held up a bank in a busy shopping street and made off with 50,000 francs ($10,000).</p>
